{"hero":{"id":63,"name":"Mina","nameRu":"Мина","className":"hero_vampirebat","description":"У Мины Ха было всё... состоятельные родители, элитное образование и договорённость о браке, благодаря которому из обычного высшего сословия она должна была перейти в самую верхушку американского общества. Она была счастлива.<br><br>А потом её «вторую половинку» убили.<br><br>Мина рыдала по украденной жизни... своей жизни. Ну почему убийца не мог подождать, пока не пройдёт свадьба? Так она бы обзавелась фамилией, о которой всегда мечтала, и ей даже не пришлось бы изображать из себя любящую супругу. Всё могло бы быть идеально, но жизнь несправедлива, и поэтому Мина сделала то, к чему всегда прибегала, когда у неё что-то не складывалось: велела родителям всё исправить.<br><br>Мистер и миссис Ха знали, что единственный способ ублажить дочь — предложить ей что-то большее взамен утраченного. А переплюнуть брак с представителем одной из самых прославленных семей мира было задачей не из простых... Им нужно было мыслить масштабно. Им нужно было мыслить нестандартно. Им нужно было предложить дочери бессмертие.<br><br>Потратив целое состояние, в конце концов они нашли вампира, который согласился обратить её. Как и следовало ожидать, Мина сочла идею с вечной молодостью и трастовым фондом приемлемым планом Б и с радостью приняла предложение. Новоиспечённая вампирша быстро обнаружила, что влияние, которое она имела в людских кругах, ничего не значило в высшем обществе вампиров... И хоть поначалу её это раздражало, если у Мины к чему-то и есть талант, так это к усвоению правил, чтобы затем обернуть их в свою пользу. Она будет виконтессой Нью-Йорка — другие вампиры просто пока об этом не знают.","descriptionEn":"Mina Ha had it all...rich parents, elite education, and an arranged marriage that would see her ascend from run-of-the-mill upper class to American royalty.  She was happy.<br><br>Then her betrothed was assassinated.<br><br>Mina wept; not for the life of her fiancé, but for the future that was stolen from her.  Why couldn't the killer just wait until after the wedding? Then she'd have the last name she always dreamed of and no one would even have to pretend to love anyone.  It could have been perfect, but life wasn't fair...and so Mina did what she always does when things don't go her way: she told her parents to fix it.<br><br>Mr. And Mrs. Ha knew that the only way to appease their daughter was to offer her something greater than what she lost... and marrying into one of the world's most lauded families was a tall order to top.  They had to think big.  They had to think outside of the box.  They had to promise their daughter immortality.<br><br>It took a small fortune, but eventually they found a vampire who was willing to turn her.  Unsurprisingly, Mina thought the idea of eternal youth and a trust fund was an acceptable plan B and happily agreed to the proposal.  Now a fledgling vampire, Mina is quickly discovering that the clout she held as a human has no weight in vampire high society...and while at first that annoyed her, if there is one thing Mina has a knack for, it's learning the rules so she can subvert them.  She will be the Viscount of New York, the other vampires just don't know it yet.","lore":"Mina Ha had it all...rich parents, elite education, and an arranged marriage that would see her ascend from run-of-the-mill upper class to American royalty.  She was happy.<br><br>Then her betrothed was assassinated.<br><br>Mina wept; not for the life of her fiancé, but for the future that was stolen from her.  Why couldn't the killer just wait until after the wedding? Then she'd have the last name she always dreamed of and no one would even have to pretend to love anyone.  It could have been perfect, but life wasn't fair...and so Mina did what she always does when things don't go her way: she told her parents to fix it.<br><br>Mr. And Mrs. Ha knew that the only way to appease their daughter was to offer her something greater than what she lost... and marrying into one of the world's most lauded families was a tall order to top.  They had to think big.  They had to think outside of the box.  They had to promise their daughter immortality.<br><br>It took a small fortune, but eventually they found a vampire who was willing to turn her.  Unsurprisingly, Mina thought the idea of eternal youth and a trust fund was an acceptable plan B and happily agreed to the proposal.  Now a fledgling vampire, Mina is quickly discovering that the clout she held as a human has no weight in vampire high society...and while at first that annoyed her, if there is one thing Mina has a knack for, it's learning the rules so she can subvert them.  She will be the Viscount of New York, the other vampires just don't know it yet.","heroRole":"","tags":["Мучительница","Проворная","Досаждающая"],"heroType":"mystic","complexity":3,"colorHex":"#A9171E","iconCard":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/vampirebat_card.png","iconSmall":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/vampirebat_sm.png","startingStats":{"max_move_speed":6.5,"sprint_speed":1.6,"crouch_speed":4.75,"move_acceleration":4,"light_melee_damage":50,"heavy_melee_damage":116,"max_health":660,"weapon_power":0,"reload_speed":1,"weapon_power_scale":1,"proc_build_up_rate_scale":1,"stamina":2,"base_health_regen":2,"stamina_regen_per_second":0.238095,"ability_resource_max":0,"ability_resource_regen_per_second":0,"crit_damage_received_scale":1,"tech_duration":1,"tech_range":1,"ground_dash_distance_in_meters":10,"ground_dash_duration":0.62,"air_dash_distance_in_meters":8,"air_dash_duration":0.43,"ooc_health_regen":0},"levelInfo":{"1":{"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityUnlocks"],"required_gold":0},"2":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityPoints"],"required_gold":200},"3":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityUnlocks"],"required_gold":500},"4":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies"